[
  {
    "screen": 1,
    "line_id": "A01",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "微信突然弹出一条消息：",
    "chars": 11
  },
  {
    "screen": 2,
    "line_id": "A01",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "多年没联系的老同学，",
    "chars": 10
  },
  {
    "screen": 3,
    "line_id": "A01",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "孩子结婚，请您去喝喜酒。",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 4,
    "line_id": "A02",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "去吧，几十年没来往，",
    "chars": 10
  },
  {
    "screen": 5,
    "line_id": "A02",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "坐那儿跟谁都聊不上；不去吧，",
    "chars": 14
  },
  {
    "screen": 6,
    "line_id": "A02",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "又怕人说不念旧情。",
    "chars": 9
  },
  {
    "screen": 7,
    "line_id": "A03",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "这事其实就看两样。",
    "chars": 9
  },
  {
    "screen": 8,
    "line_id": "A04",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "第一看交情：",
    "chars": 6
  },
  {
    "screen": 9,
    "line_id": "A04",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "当年是真有过交情、",
    "chars": 9
  },
  {
    "screen": 10,
    "line_id": "A04",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "只是各忙各的，这种帖该去，",
    "chars": 13
  },
  {
    "screen": 11,
    "line_id": "A04",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "去了，老交情还能续上；",
    "chars": 11
  },
  {
    "screen": 12,
    "line_id": "A04",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "要是当年就没说过几句话、",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 13,
    "line_id": "A04",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "群发式的请帖，回句祝福，",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 14,
    "line_id": "A04",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "不去也不亏心。",
    "chars": 7
  },
  {
    "screen": 15,
    "line_id": "A05",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "随礼就一条：多年不来往的，",
    "chars": 13
  },
  {
    "screen": 16,
    "line_id": "A05",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "按普通交情走，不撑面子，",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 17,
    "line_id": "A05",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "也不特殊。",
    "chars": 5
  },
  {
    "screen": 18,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "第二看回话：",
    "chars": 6
  },
  {
    "screen": 19,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "去不去都早给人准信，",
    "chars": 10
  },
  {
    "screen": 20,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "人家要按人数订桌，",
    "chars": 9
  },
  {
    "screen": 21,
    "line_id": "A06",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "您拖着不吭声，就是给人添乱。",
    "chars": 14
  },
  {
    "screen": 22,
    "line_id": "A07",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "《中国式人情世故》",
    "chars": 9
  },
  {
    "screen": 23,
    "line_id": "A07",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "讲的就是这个理：",
    "chars": 8
  },
  {
    "screen": 24,
    "line_id": "A07",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "交情在平时的往来里，",
    "chars": 10
  },
  {
    "screen": 25,
    "line_id": "A07",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "不在临时的热闹里。",
    "chars": 9
  },
  {
    "screen": 26,
    "line_id": "A08",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "平时不往来，临时抱佛脚，",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 27,
    "line_id": "A08",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "抱的不是交情，是尴尬。",
    "chars": 11
  },
  {
    "screen": 28,
    "line_id": "A09",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "这样的请帖，您收到过吗？",
    "chars": 12
  },
  {
    "screen": 29,
    "line_id": "A10",
    "role": "爷爷",
    "text": "最后去了没有？",
    "chars": 7
  }
]